sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant A as Worker A
    participant D as Durable job state
    participant B as Compatible worker B
    S->>D: Record attempt 1 and its lease
    S->>A: Assign work
    A->>S: Heartbeats and progress
    Note over A,S: Worker A disconnects
    S->>D: Revoke or expire attempt 1
    S->>D: Record permitted retry or replacement plan
    S->>B: Assign attempt 2
    B->>S: Return result
    S->>D: Accept the current attempt's result
    A-->>S: Late result from attempt 1
    S-->>A: Reject superseded attempt
